Appliance ISO image
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The bootable ISO image is an aggregate of this project and Debian GNU/Linux
packages (including the Linux kernel, FRRouting, nftables, strongSwan,
WireGuard tools, nginx, Apache httpd, PHP, Python and guacd). Those packages
keep their own licences, some of which are the GNU GPL. Where to obtain their
corresponding source code is described in README.md, "Source code for the
ISO image".
